                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On 20 october 2024 Skillbook Skill Development Centre conducted a comprehensive Mould Design Workshop at its Rohini Sector-6 facility, near Vishram Chowk, New Delhi. The workshop was designed to introduce students to the principles and applications of mould design, focusing on its role within manufacturing and engineering industries.
                                    Led by expert tutors, participants explored core concepts of mould design, including tool selection, material properties, and industry-standard software used in the design process. Through hands-on learning, students gained valuable insights into the technicalities and applications of mould design, further enhancing their employability in fields like automotive, aerospace, and consumer goods manufacturing.
                                    Students were highly engaged throughout the workshop, asking questions and actively participating in live demos and exercises. The event concluded with students expressing appreciation for the practical knowledge gained, recognizing Skillbook's dedication to preparing them for successful careers. This workshop was yet another step in Skillbook’s mission to empower students with the specialized skills needed to thrive in modern industries.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
